'''Ms. Madonna''' (マドンナ先生 ''Madonna-sensei'', '''Teacher Madonna''') is a [[:Category:Traitless Enemies|Traitless]] enemy introduced in [[Spring for Sensei (Monthly Event)|Spring for Sensei]]. She was added in [[Version 8.3 Update|Version 8.3]].

