==Trivia==
*''Madonna'' (マドンナ) is a slang term for a woman who is adored by many men.
*Her and [[Doctor K.O.]] are the only [[Kang Roo]] variants that don't have a [[wikipedia:Marsupial#Early development|joey]].
*She is one of the only [[Kang Roo]] variants to not have [[Multi-Hit]], the other being [[Scissoroo]].

